# Public half of the release signing key (an SSH Ed25519 public key, one line). Compiled into the CLI:
# `cyanotype update` only installs builds whose SHA256SUMS is signed by this key.
# While this file holds no key line, `cyanotype update` refuses everything. Setup: docs/releases.md.
ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMxFd2kaxohHivk7pehLWHrSK5834yrieu1YjRn/fSXv cyanotype-cli-release
